  "visualBrief": "Connected native château with open courtyard: square keep/four great round towers, four separate steep hipped pavilion roofs, central open stone lantern to56m, six restored open corner lanterns, chapel/royal side wings, recessed connecting galleries and low enclosure/two flat front towers. Three-storey pilaster/moulding facade grid, crossed windows and upper open gallery bays, true courtyard entrance portal, supported exterior circular staircases, native roof dormers/chimneys/stair turrets with original restrained circular/diamond inlays and abstract relief. Current2025 aerial controls silhouette and restored blue-grey lead; older close photos control stone/window forms. Gardens, detached buildings, moat, interiors, people and photo textures excluded.",
